{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はせかせかしてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/02/1519566/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝からママと買い物して、\nお仕事行って、\nみさとあみとご飯食べて、\n今はホテルにいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/02/1519566/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に服！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/02/1519566/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベレー帽 FREAK'S STORE\nニット 45rpm\nワンピース PAR ICI\n靴 Dr.Martens"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このワンピース\nオークションで買ったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/02/1519566/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"形もデザインもぐるぐるカーテンの\n衣装そっくりなのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさとあみとご飯食べる前に\n買い物ついてったんだけど、\nみさ先輩ぼけぼけしてたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の前にある行きたいお店\n通り過ぎるとか、\nなんか今日いっぱいあったのよ笑\nありすぎてそれしか覚えてない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/02/1519566/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ご飯美味しかったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/02/1519566/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人部屋さみしかったから、\nみさとペアにしてもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ってブログに書いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/02/1519566/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われたら仕方なく書いてあげた\nまりっかでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}